WEBVTT

00:11:29.245 --> 00:11:33.007
So, we're currently I don't know how many
tens of thousands of hours of work in,

00:11:33.031 --> 00:11:35.434
and we're two months out
from the 2019 Hunt.

00:11:35.458 --> 00:11:38.151
So, thank you for listening,
I have to go write a puzzle.

00:11:38.175 --> 00:11:39.420
(Laughter)

00:11:39.444 --> 00:11:42.087
(Applause)